[
  {
    "content_id": "10029001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;以下是耶和華對毗土珥的兒子約珥所說的話。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;長老們啊，要聽此言！ 此地所有的居民啊，要留心聽！ 在你們或你們祖先的時代可曾發生過這樣的事？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;要把這事告訴你們的子子孫孫， 傳到世世代代！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;蝗蟲吃剩的，蝻子來吃； 蝻子吃剩的，蚱蜢來吃； 蚱蜢吃剩的，螞蚱來吃。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;醉酒之徒啊，醒過來哭泣吧！ 貪杯的人啊，哀號吧！ 你們再無美酒可飲了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;有一群強大的隊伍侵犯我的國土， 牠們不計其數， 有雄獅的獠牙和母獅的利齒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;牠們毀壞我的葡萄樹和無花果樹， 剝光樹皮，然後丟棄， 只留下光禿的樹枝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我的子民啊，你們要哀哭， 像身披麻衣的少女哭她的未婚夫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;耶和華殿中的素祭和奠祭都停止了， 事奉耶和華的祭司都哀傷。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;田園荒廢，遍地淒涼， 五穀盡毀， 再也沒有新酒和油了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;農夫啊，你們要憂傷！ 照料葡萄園的人啊， 你們要哀號！ 因為田間的大麥和小麥全毀了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;葡萄樹枯死， 無花果樹凋殘， 石榴樹、棕樹、蘋果樹等田野的一切樹木枯乾。 人間的歡樂消逝了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;祭司啊，披上麻衣痛哭吧； 在祭壇前事奉的人啊，要哀號； 我上帝的僕人啊，要披上麻衣過夜； 因為再無素祭和奠祭獻到你們上帝的殿中了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你們要宣佈禁食的聖日， 舉行莊嚴的聚會， 召集長老和當地所有居民， 到你們的上帝耶和華的殿中， 向耶和華呼求。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;那日可怕呀！耶和華的日子近了， 那是全能者施行毀滅的日子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我們親眼看著糧食斷絕， 我們上帝殿中的歡樂消失。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;種子在土裡腐爛， 五穀枯死，倉庫荒廢， 穀倉被拆毀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;牲畜哀鳴， 牛群因無草場而彷徨， 羊群也受苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，我向你呼求， 因為火焰吞滅了曠野的草場， 烈火燒光了田野的樹木。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;田野的走獸向你呼求， 因為溪水已經枯乾， 火也燒盡了曠野的草場。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你們要在錫安吹響號角， 在我的聖山上發出警訊， 此地的居民都要顫抖， 因為耶和華的日子將要來臨， 已經近了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;那是昏暗陰沉的日子， 是烏雲密佈的日子。 來了一支空前絕後、強盛無比的大軍， 牠們像曙光一樣佈滿山嶺。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;牠們前面有燎原之火， 後面有熊熊烈焰。 牠們到來之前， 大地就像伊甸園； 牠們過去之後， 大地變成荒涼的曠野。 地上的一切都逃不過這一場浩劫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;牠們的形狀像馬， 疾馳如戰馬，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;在山嶺上跳躍奔騰， 如隆隆戰車， 好像烈火吞噬乾草的聲音， 又如大軍列陣備戰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;百姓一看到牠們，就驚慌失措， 面如死灰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;牠們快速奔跑像勇士， 攀登城牆如戰士， 有條不紊地前進。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;隊伍整齊，各行其道， 長驅直入，勢不可擋。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;牠們衝向城邑，躥上城牆， 爬進房屋， 如盜賊般破窗而入。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;所到之處， 天搖地動， 日月昏暗， 星辰無光。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;耶和華向祂的軍隊發號施令， 祂的隊伍不計其數， 執行祂命令的是勁旅。 耶和華的日子偉大而可畏， 誰能承受得住呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說： 「現在你們要禁食、哭泣、哀號， 全心回轉歸向我。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你們要撕心般地痛悔， 而不是撕裂衣服。 歸向你們的上帝耶和華吧， 因為祂有恩典、好憐憫， 不輕易發怒， 充滿慈愛， 不忍心降災禍。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;或許祂轉念心生憐憫， 給你們留下祝福， 使你們可以再次向你們的上帝耶和華獻上素祭和奠祭。 有誰知道呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;要在錫安山吹響號角， 宣佈禁食的聖日， 舉行莊嚴的聚會。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;要招聚老人， 聚集孩童和吃奶的嬰兒； 要吩咐新郎出洞房、 新娘出內室； 要召集全體人民， 讓會眾潔淨自己。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;讓事奉耶和華的祭司站在聖殿門廊和祭壇中間， 哭泣懇求說： 「耶和華啊， 求你顧惜你的子民， 不要讓外族人侮辱、 譏笑你的產業說， 『他們的上帝在哪裡呢？』」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;耶和華篤愛祂的土地， 祂憐憫自己的子民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;祂回應他們說： 「我必賜五穀、新酒和橄欖油給你們， 使你們飽足， 不再讓你們受列國的羞辱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我要使北方的軍隊遠離你們， 把他們驅逐到一個乾旱荒蕪的地方， 把他們的領頭部隊趕進死海， 再把他們的殿後部隊趕進地中海， 那時他們必臭氣沖天、 惡味上騰， 因為耶和華為你們行了大事。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;土地啊，不要害怕， 倒要歡喜快樂； 因為耶和華行了大事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;田野的走獸啊，不要害怕， 因為青草鋪遍了曠野， 樹木也結滿了果子， 無花果樹和葡萄樹都結實纍纍。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;錫安的人民啊， 你們要快樂， 因你們的上帝耶和華而喜樂。 因為祂按時降下甘霖， 像從前一樣賜給你們秋雨和 春雨。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;麥場必堆滿五穀， 酒槽裡的酒和油槽裡的油必滿溢。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002025",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;「我派蝻蟲、蚱蜢、螞蚱 和蝗蟲大軍在那些年所吃掉的， 我要補償你們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002026",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;你們必吃得飽足， 並讚美你們的上帝耶和華的名， 因祂為你們行了奇事。 我的子民永遠不會再蒙羞。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002027",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;這樣，你們就知道我在以色列， 知道我是你們的上帝耶和華， 除我以外別無他神。 我的子民永遠不會再蒙羞。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002028",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;「以後，我要將我的靈澆灌所有的人。 你們的兒女要說預言， 老人要做異夢， 青年要見異象。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002029",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;在那些日子， 我要將我的靈澆灌我的奴僕和婢女。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002030",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:30",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002030",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>30</sup>&nbsp;「我要在天上地下行奇事，你們將看見血、火和煙柱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002031",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:31",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002031",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>31</sup>&nbsp;太陽要變得昏暗，月亮要變得血紅。在耶和華偉大而可畏的日子來臨以前，這些事都會發生。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002032",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 2:32",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002032",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>32</sup>&nbsp;那時候，凡求告耶和華之名的人都必得救，因為在錫安山，在耶路撒冷城，必有逃脫災難的人，耶和華所呼召的人必倖存下來，正如耶和華所言。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;「到那日，我要使猶大和耶路撒冷被擄的人返鄉。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;那時，我要聚集萬國，帶他們下到約沙法谷，在那裡審判他們，因為他們把我的子民，就是我的產業以色列，分散到各國，並瓜分我的土地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;他們抽籤分了我的子民，將男童換妓女，賣女童買酒喝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;「泰爾、西頓和非利士境內所有的人啊，你們為什麼這樣對我？你們要報復我嗎？如果你們是報復我，我必速速使你們遭報應。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你們奪去我的金銀，搶走我的珍寶，拿去放在你們的廟中，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;並把猶大和耶路撒冷的居民賣給希臘人，使他們遠離家鄉。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;然而，他們被賣到哪裡，我要促使他們從哪裡離開，並要使你們得到報應，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我必把你們的兒女賣給猶大人，猶大人必把他們賣給遠方的示巴人。這是耶和華說的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你們去向列國宣告： 「要召集勇士，徵調軍隊， 前去打仗！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;要將犁頭打成刀劍， 把鐮刀鑄成矛頭， 弱者要說自己是勇士！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;四圍的列國啊， 你們快快聚集到那裡吧！」 耶和華啊， 求你差遣大能的勇士降臨。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;「列國都要起來， 上到約沙法谷， 因為我要坐在那裡審判周邊列國。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;開鐮吧，因為莊稼熟了； 踩踏吧，因為榨酒池的葡萄滿了。 酒池滿溢，因為他們惡貫滿盈。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;千千萬萬的人聚集在審判谷， 因為耶和華的日子要臨到那裡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;日月昏暗， 星辰無光。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;耶和華從錫安發出怒吼， 從耶路撒冷發出雷聲， 天地為之震動。 但耶和華卻是祂子民的避難所， 是以色列人的堡壘。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;「這樣，你們就知道我是你們的上帝耶和華， 我住在我的聖山錫安。 耶路撒冷必為聖城， 外族人必不再侵犯它。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;「到那日，群山要滴下甜酒， 丘陵要流出乳汁。 猶大的溪澗碧水常流， 必有清泉從耶和華的殿中流出， 澆灌什亭谷。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;埃及必一片荒涼， 以東必成為荒涼的曠野， 因為他們曾殘暴地對待猶大人， 在猶大濫殺無辜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;但猶大必常有人住， 耶路撒冷必存到萬代。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約珥書 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我必追討尚未追討的血債， 因為耶和華住在錫安。」</p>"
  }
]